     <property name="text">
      <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Building Blocks Creation - Help&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Overview&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Building Blocks function combines ALKIS and ATKIS data for semi-automatic creation of building blocks through intersection of various geodata layers.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Required Inputs&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Municipal Boundary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Polygon layer with the outer municipal boundary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defines the spatial framework for building block creation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Should encompass the entire area to be processed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;District Boundaries:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Polygon layer with district/cadastral boundaries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subdivides the municipality into administrative units&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Important for correct assignment of building blocks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Land Use Types:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Polygon layer with various land use types (ALKIS/ATKIS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contains information about residential areas, commercial areas, roads, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basis for thematic classification of building blocks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Processing Workflow&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intersection:&lt;/strong&gt; The tool analyzes spatial overlaps between the three input layers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Geometry Creation:&lt;/strong&gt; A new building block is created for each intersection area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attribution:&lt;/strong&gt; Each building block automatically receives attributes from all participating layers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Area Calculation:&lt;/strong&gt; The area of each building block is automatically calculated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Output Attributes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;block_id:&lt;/strong&gt; Unique identification number&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;community:&lt;/strong&gt; Name of the municipality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;gemarkung:&lt;/strong&gt; Name of the district/cadastral area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;usage_type:&lt;/strong&gt; Type of land use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;area_sqm:&lt;/strong&gt; Area of the building block in square meters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Tips for Best Results&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All input layers should be in the same coordinate system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Check data quality before processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Large datasets may require considerable processing time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The result is automatically added to the map when the option is enabled&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Data Sources&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Suitable data can be obtained from &lt;a href="https://opendata.kreis-guetersloh.de"&gt;opendata.kreis-guetersloh.de&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
